{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11112090","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11112090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1111209001:2":{"text":"아이를 괴롭히고 싶지는 않아요. 어쨌든 전 당신을 무조건 데리고 가야 해요. 그게 제 유일한 목적이라고요!","source_cn":"我可不想欺负小孩！总之，我一定要带安丹德拉离开，这是我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD863A1ADCABAB69C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1111209002:1":{"text":"사트라나, 아이들에게 내가 필요하다는 걸 네가 이해해 줘야 한다고 생각해.","source_cn":"萨忒娜，这些孩子非常需要我，你能理解才对。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB67AA82B5BBC1FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111209003:2":{"text":"저도 당신이 필요해요! 하지만 그때 당신은 날 떠나버렸죠. 너무하다고 생각하지 않나요?","source_cn":"我也很需要你！可当年你还不是抛下我一走了之？你太偏心了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AB5FE23AF910367","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111209004:1":{"text":"그땐 다른 선택지가 없었어...","source_cn":"我那时没有别的选择……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB465CFDDB75D297","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111209005:1":{"text":"넌 항상 똑똑하고 용감한 아이였으니까. 난 네가 너 스스로를 지킬 수 있을 거라고 생각했어.","source_cn":"我知道你会照顾好自己。你是个聪明又勇敢的好孩子，一直都是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2AE495B3384B27F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111209006:2":{"text":"그런 입에 발린 말 몇 마디로 제가 당신을 용서할 거 같아요? 자기 자신은 위할 줄 모르는 당신의 그 태도가 더 짜증 난다고요!","source_cn":"别以为说了这些好听的我就会原谅你！你不顾自身安危的样子...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F5D8F179B820A2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111209007:1":{"text":"내 안전도 중요하지만 아이들이 위험에 처하는 상황을 두고 볼 순 없어.","source_cn":"我在乎自己的安全，但我不能看着孩子们受伤。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B60EB06849F4C76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111209008:1":{"text":"이곳은 도적들뿐 아니라, 크림슨 고원에서 미쳐 날뛰는 동물들에게도 자주 습격을 당하곤 해.","source_cn":"这里不仅有匪徒窥伺，还有许多发了疯的动物们从深红高原那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2C5700DF4054AAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1111209009:1":{"text":"크림슨 고원? 아... 역시 문제가 있네요.","source_cn":"深红高原？嗯……果然有问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF6B23B0768DF643","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1111209010:1":{"text":"뭔가 알고 있어?","source_cn":"你们知道什么吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD89DD99B161793C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1111209010":{"text":"뭔가 알고 있어?","source_cn":"你们知道什么吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD89DD99B161793C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1111209011:1":{"text":"뭐...? 크림슨 고원에 보물이 있다는 소문이... 사막을 혼란스럽게 만든 이유였구나.","source_cn":"什么……深红高原的宝藏传闻，竟然是让沙漠产生动荡的根源。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6119590B92B5506","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1111209013:1":{"text":"아직 밝혀지지 않은 의문점이 많아요. 진실을 조사하기 위해서 크림슨 고원으로 가던 길이었고요.","source_cn":"目前还有很多疑点，为了调查真相，我们正在向深红高原前进。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6770560A62464F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1111209014:1":{"text":"귀여운 햄스터가 머리까지 좋네, 정말 대단한데?","source_cn":"仓鼠这么可爱，还这么聪明，好厉害啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81AAFEC8126EDC23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1111209015:1":{"text":"핫... 칭, 칭찬해 준 거니까, 햄스터라고 부른 건 봐드리죵...","source_cn":"看、看在你夸我的份上，就不计较你喊我仓鼠了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BA1C83B45EADA0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1111209016:0":{"text":"사트라나, 나를 꼭 데리고 가야겠다면 너희랑 같이 크림슨 고원에 가도 될까?","source_cn":"萨忒娜，我在想，既然你要带我离开，我能不能和你们一起去...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC4954D3884BE0EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1111209017:0":{"text":"너무 위험하지 않을까요? 전 크림슨 고원으로 갈 생각이 없어요. 당신을 데리고 이 위험한 곳을 당장 벗어나고 싶다고요...","source_cn":"那不是更危险吗？我没打算继续向深红高原前进，我想带你离...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E23EB66FD6B73EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1111209018:0":{"text":"날 데려가고 싶은 거 아니었어? 여기서 일어나는 문제를 해결하고 아이들이 안전해질 수 있다면 나도 안심하고 떠날 수 있을 거야.","source_cn":"你不是想带我走吗？如果能解决动荡的根源，给孩子们真正安...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C48C52C20245F80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1111209019:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 어떻게 생각하세요? 전 잘 모르겠어요...","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x096E5E266F1C23FC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 어떻게 생각하세요? 전 잘 모르겠어요...","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 어떻게 생각하세요? 전 잘 모르겠어요...","variant_male_record_index":"122860","variant_female_record_index":"122861","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:24:1111209019":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 어떻게 생각하세요? 전 잘 모르겠어요...","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name></style>，你怎么看？我现在没有头绪了……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x096E5E266F1C23FC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 어떻게 생각하세요? 전 잘 모르겠어요...","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 어떻게 생각하세요? 전 잘 모르겠어요...","variant_male_record_index":"122860","variant_female_record_index":"122861","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1111209020:1":{"text":"고마워. 분명 도움이 될 거야.","source_cn":"感谢你的接纳，请你相信我会派上用场。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x26971F325F9224BC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"고마워. 분명 도움이 될 거야.","female":"고마워. 분명 도움이 될 거야.","variant_male_record_index":"122862","variant_female_record_index":"122863","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1111209022:3":{"text":"언니가 간다면 나도 같이 갈 거야!","source_cn":"如果你要离开，那我也一起去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32B17F1CE4F90F9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1111209023:0":{"text":"카이, 부족원들은 네가 필요해. 너는 여기 남아서 그들을 지켜줘.","source_cn":"卡卡，你的族人们需要你。你应该留在这里保护他们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6614FBDF5AA42C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1111209024:1":{"text":"거짓말! 내가 위험할까 봐 거짓말하는 거잖아!","source_cn":"说谎！你是怕我遇到危险才说谎！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCCB8A95E750A8C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1111209025:1":{"text":"언니, 나도 갈래!","source_cn":"安丹姐姐！我要跟你走！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x509D784317A8C6C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1111209026:1":{"text":"카이, 떼쓰지 마. 이번엔 무슨 말을 해도 절대 안 돼.","source_cn":"卡卡，不要任性。这一次无论你说什么，我都不会同意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECDD6110512624B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1111209027:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1111209028:1":{"text":"쳇! 언니가 세상에서 제일 미워!","source_cn":"我最讨厌安丹姐姐了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6443219F593FAE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1111209029:0":{"text":"갔네요... 이제 출발하죠...","source_cn":"终于走了……我们也出发吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA64C5785B2582734","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1111209030:0":{"text":"미안... 조금만 기다려줄 수 있을까? 사방이 위험한데 카이가 충동적으로 무슨 짓을 할까 봐 걱정돼서.","source_cn":"抱歉……能请大家稍等吗？周围如此危险，我怕卡卡这孩子冲...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2028BA98477DCF43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1111209031:1":{"text":"카이를 찾아서 너희를 두고 떠나려는 게 아니라고 분명하게 말해주고 싶어.","source_cn":"我想找到她，和她说明白，我并不是想要抛下他们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5972D1047E7B7C3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:24:0:1":{"text":"사람이 많을수록 강해지니까, 같이 가자","source_cn":"一起去吧，人多力量大","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3E9D295DB43A4EB9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"사람이 많을수록 강해지니까, 같이 가자","female":"사람이 많을수록 강해지니까, 같이 가자","variant_male_record_index":"63704","variant_female_record_index":"63705","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1111209021:1":{"text":"이래 봬도 부족에서 추방되기 전엔 손꼽히는 전사였어. 걱정하지 마. 민폐 끼치진 않을 테니까.","source_cn":"被自己的部落驱逐前，我好歹也是一名战士，请放心，我不会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C1B1C3A13EBB268","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:24:1:2":{"text":"그녀가 위험해지면...","source_cn":"万一她遇到危险……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB94920723CB5AF31","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그녀가 위험해지면...","female":"그녀가 위험해지면...","variant_male_record_index":"63706","variant_female_record_index":"63707","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:0:1":{"